1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:04,247
Pantry Weave: several recipes, one grocery list.

2
00:00:04,282 --> 00:00:07,440
Recorded on the public website, without signing in.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:13,352
Read the photo in your ChatGPT conversation, then open its recipe link.

4
00:00:13,387 --> 00:00:16,395
Image reading happens outside this website.

5
00:00:17,235 --> 00:00:20,137
This recipe was transcribed before recording.

6
00:00:20,172 --> 00:00:21,813
Review before adding.

7
00:00:21,848 --> 00:00:25,830
Amounts and servings not stated in the source remain unknown.

8
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:31,005
Switch the review to Chinese, including supported ingredient names.

9
00:00:31,835 --> 00:00:34,655
Confirm the ingredients to add the first dish.

10
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,530
Add Apple Coleslaw.

11
00:00:38,565 --> 00:00:41,910
The source serves twelve; fractional amounts are kept.

12
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,298
Choose green OR red cabbage.

13
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:48,265
Alternatives are not silently added together.

14
00:00:49,315 --> 00:00:51,343
Both dishes feed one list.

15
00:00:51,378 --> 00:00:56,535
Compatible amounts combine; unknown amounts remain separate from measured amounts.

16
00:00:57,355 --> 00:00:59,208
Adjust the meal to three people.

17
00:00:59,243 --> 00:01:02,675
Only recipes with a known serving count are scaled.

18
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:06,755
Recipes remain editable after import.

19
00:01:06,790 --> 00:01:09,635
Here we add a preparation note from the source.

20
00:01:10,755 --> 00:01:12,845
Already have salt? Tick it off.

21
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:15,850
It will be excluded from the shopping-list export.

22
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:20,165
Save the remaining ingredients as one clear image.

23
00:01:23,715 --> 00:01:25,680
Export a Chinese version too.

24
00:01:25,715 --> 00:01:28,435
You can view the saved image while shopping.

25
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:32,613
Prefer plain text?

26
00:01:32,648 --> 00:01:34,955
Download the remaining shopping list.

27
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:39,588
Refresh: both recipes and pantry checks are still here.

28
00:01:39,623 --> 00:01:42,680
This signed-out demo saves in the current browser.

29
00:01:45,595 --> 00:01:47,135
Try the public website.

30
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:49,073
Source code is on GitHub.

31
00:01:49,108 --> 00:01:54,615
Cloud sign-in, cloud sync and live AI recognition are not shown in this recording.
